==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Spewpa|12}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*'''Signs of Evolution''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Skyridge|Magikarp|75}} from the {{TCG|Skyridge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

